  "description": "LeMrosh in the Lazy Kingdom is a funny point-and-click adventure game set in a medieval kingdom where nothing is as it seems. What starts out as a simple quest quickly turns into a tangle of puzzles, strange items and quirky characters. Explore, experiment, and talk along the way through a kingdom where even the wrong choices can lead to unexpected (and often hilarious) results - whether you mean to or not.\n\nFEATURES\n■ Classic point-and-click adventure game inspired by 90’s legends\n■ Over 12 hours of story-driven gameplay with multiple twists\n■ Solve clever and unconventional puzzles\n■ Explore over 200 unique locations across a strange medieval kingdom\n■ Meet a large cast of quirky and memorable characters\n■ Full English voiceover across the entire game\n■ Unique interactions: most actions trigger custom, often humorous responses\n■ Experiment freely - even wrong choices can lead to funny outcomes\n■ Clean interface with intuitive actions (examine, use, talk, collect)\n■ A lighthearted story with a touch of romance\n\nAs LeMrosh says: \"Spin it like never before.\"\n\nIf you enjoy classic adventure games, witty humor, and discovering unexpected solutions, LeMrosh in the Lazy Kingdom is waiting.",
